  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Portal for Water Accounting Information</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is to provide guidance, information and data on water accounting to countries and engage with donors and institutions to raise the profile of water accounting globally. 
The long-term impact of the project supports increased water use efficiency (Sustainable Development Goal - SDG 6.4), Increased agricultural production (SDG 2.4) and sustainable irrigation management and crop production.</narrative>
  </description>
